			(property "Description" "ICM-20948 9 Degree of Freedom IMU\n\nWorld’s lowest power 9-axis MotionTracking device that is ideally suited for smartphones, tablets, wearable sensors, and IoT applications. Includes onboard Digital Motion Processor to offload computations from the host processor\n\nDatasheet\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• SparkFun IMU Breakout - ICM-20948"
